    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the alcoholic beverage control law, in relation to licensing\nrestrictions for manufacturers and wholesalers of alcoholic beverages on\nlicensees who sell at retail for on-premises consumption; and to repeal\ncertain provisions of such law relating thereto",
    "basePrintNo": "S9013",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9013-2021",
